# search-router config for MAINLAND-CHINA / NO-VPN servers
# (e.g. the Qiniu Cloud host). Copy to the path printed by `s --config`.
#
# Every backend below is reachable WITHOUT a proxy or VPN from inside China:
#   bing        — cn.bing.com SERP scrape (zero-key, region-locked, Chinese-friendly)
#   hackernews  — Algolia HN API (zero-key, English/tech only)
#   github-repos— GitHub search API (zero-key)
#   crossref    — DOI / paper metadata (zero-key)
#   tavily      — needs TAVILY_API_KEY (optional)
#
# Deliberately EXCLUDED (blocked / not installed on the remote host):
#   wikipedia   — fully blocked in China
#   anysearch   — not deployed on the remote
#   searxng     — no instance configured
#   wigolo      — Docker not available on the remote
#   crawl4ai    — heavy deps (Playwright/Chromium); skipped for disk space
#
# NOTE: Bing occasionally serves a CAPTCHA to a fresh session's first request.
# The bing adapter retries once; if it still fails, the chain moves on.

# ── URLs: fetch, don't search ─────────────────────────────────────────
^https?://.*                     => http

# ── Bare stock codes (Chinese A-share style) ─────────────────────────
^[0-9]{6}$                       => bing

# ── Chinese-language intent routing ───────────────────────────────────
# Bing is the only Chinese-capable zero-key backend here; don't fall back to
# HN (English-only, returns nothing for Chinese → wastes a round-trip).
股价|行情|市值|财报|市盈|开盘         => bing
论文|文献|期刊|DOI|arXiv|PMID       => crossref | bing
法条|判例|司法解释|法规|条例           => bing
汇率|外汇|货币                     => bing
加密货币|比特币|以太坊|BTC|ETH        => bing

# ── English-language / tech intent routing ───────────────────────────
[Dd][Oo][Cc][Kk][Ee][Rr]|[Kk][Uu][Bb][Ee][Rr][Nn][Ee][Tt][Ee][Ss]|[Rr][Uu][Ss][Tt]|[Pp][Yy][Tt][Hh][Oo][Nn]  => hackernews | bing
[Ll][Ii][Bb][Rr][Aa][Rr][Yy]|[Pp][Aa][Cc][Kk][Aa][Gg][Ee]|[Ff][Rr][Aa][Mm][Ee][Ww][Oo][Rr][Kk]  => github-repos | hackernews | bing
[Aa][Rr][Xx][Ii][Vv]|[Dd][Oo][Ii]|[Pp][Aa][Pp][Ee][Rr]|[Jj][Oo][Uu][Rr][Nn][Aa][Ll]  => crossref | bing | hackernews

# ── Default: Bing first (Chinese-capable), then English/tech backends ──
*                                => bing | hackernews | github-repos | tavily
